{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LxlmNyGuWy1795150203.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國際貨幣基金組織(IMF)警告，若人工智能(AI)融資市場繼續調整的話，可能威脅金融穩定。股評人李澤銘表示，相關論述的看法長遠，而且科企在銀行中的融資比例不算高，即使發生風險，對金融系統的影響間接。對於近期金融股調整，他認為跟經濟衰退預期有關。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T05:43:58.701268+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T04:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T10:37:12.485268+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:37:16.431224+00:00","content_hash":"eff53eee628e3f757580239d9b3650b4d6cea901702c3729635f19528d3b8c26","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T05:43:58.701268+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}